| RISC3D test: OpenGL 1.x/2.1 (immediate mode, lighting, textures,
| display lists, vertex arrays, selection) drawn by Linux's driver. Writes
| GLResults and GLPicture (a PPM picture) in this folder.
| Run "install" on the Linux side first (see !ReadMe).
RMEnsure RISC3D 0.01 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.RISC3D
RMEnsure Linux3D 0.01 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.Linux3D
Run <Obey$Dir>.gl1test <Obey$Dir>.GLPicture { > <Obey$Dir>.GLResults }
Run <Obey$Dir>.gl1test bench { >> <Obey$Dir>.GLResults }
SetType <Obey$Dir>.GLResults Text
Filer_Run <Obey$Dir>.GLResults
